abstract: "Public Part I physics archive for Constraint-Driven Field Theory / Constraint-Driven Flux Dynamics (release v1.1.0). Twelve article-class manuscripts with supplementary scripts, interactive panels, bibliography, claim-status and correction-status ledgers, and a minimal demo. This honesty revision treats named capacity, operating-ratio, memory, and test constructs as postulated CDFT notation and falsifiable targets—not established physical laws. Open preprint material; not peer reviewed. Separate from the AGPL CDFD Runtime."
